      "content": "that's a good start, but it feels a little too soft. i want to make sure they understand that being late to stand-ups actually disrupts the whole team's workflow and isn't just a minor thing. can you make the section about punctuality sound a bit more serious and professional? maybe emphasize that it's a requirement for their seniority level.",
