      "content": "Here's a revised draft that maintains a balance between accountability and appreciation: \"I've been impressed with your exceptional performance in retaining our key clients and ensuring their continued satisfaction. However, I want to discuss the recurring issue of tardiness to our internal morning stand-up meetings. As a senior account executive, I expect you to uphold the leadership standards of our team and set an example for your colleagues. Tardiness to meetings not only disrupts the team's workflow but also impacts our ability to align on priorities, share updates, and plan our day effectively. While this behavior affects our team's productivity, it is not a reflection of my opinion on your abilities as an account executive. I continue to value your contributions to our team and the value you bring to our clients, and I appreciate your hard work and dedication to our business. If you're experiencing any underlying issues that may be contributing to your tardiness, I encourage you to bring them to my attention so we can work together to find a solution.\"",
